+    The lookup table is built on the first lookup and cached after a successful build,
+    even if it is empty. If building fails, the exception is propagated and partial
+    results are discarded. The next lookup retries the build.
+
     If decorated function has arguments then separate lookuper with its own lookup table is created for each combination of arguments. This can be used to make lookup tables on demand::
 
         @make_lookuper
